## 🎬 INTERACTIVE ELEMENTS

### Navigation Behavior
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Scroll Position       Navigation State         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Top (0-100px)    →   Transparent navbar        │
│  Scrolling down   →   Solid navbar with shadow  │
│  Scrolling up     →   Navbar visible            │
│  Scrolling down   →   Navbar hidden (optional)  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Hover States & Micro-interactions
- **Buttons:** Scale up 1.05x, shadow deepens
- **Feature cards:** Lift effect (translateY -5px)
- **Links:** Underline animation (left to right)
- **Icons:** Subtle rotate or bounce animation

### Scroll Animations (using AOS or Intersection Observer)
```
Section Entry          Animation Effect
─────────────          ────────────────
Hero                →  Fade in from bottom
Features            →  Fade in + scale (staggered)
How It Works        →  Slide in from left (steps)
Benefits            →  Flip in (card rotation)
Technology          →  Fade in from top
Stats               →  Count-up animation
CTA                 →  Pulse effect
```

