## 🎨 PROGRESSIVE DISCLOSURE

### Information Architecture
```
Level 1: Headlines          → Grab attention
Level 2: Subheadings        → Explain value
Level 3: Body copy          → Provide details
Level 4: CTAs              → Drive action

Example:
────────
"AI-Powered Grading System"           [Level 1]
   ↓
"Transform Assessment with             [Level 2]
 Intelligent Automation"
   ↓
"Save 80% of grading time while        [Level 3]
 providing better feedback..."
   ↓
[Request a Demo]                       [Level 4]
```

---

## 🔄 CONVERSION FUNNELS

### Primary Conversion Path
```
Hero CTA → Demo Request Form → Thank You Page
  (60%)      (40% complete)      (90% convert)
```

### Secondary Paths
```
1. Features → Benefits → CTA → Contact Form
2. How It Works → CTA → Email Contact
3. Technology → Trust Build → CTA → Demo Request
```

### Exit Intent Strategy
```
User moves cursor to close tab
         ↓
Trigger modal: "Wait! See it in action"
         ↓
   [Watch 1-min Demo]
   [Download Case Study]
```

