## 🎯 ENGAGEMENT METRICS TO TRACK

1. **Time on page:** Target 2-3 minutes
2. **Scroll depth:** % reaching CTA section
3. **Click-through rate:** Hero CTA vs. bottom CTA
4. **Form completion:** Demo request submissions
5. **Bounce rate:** Target <40%

